When running in `--check` mode without a pre-existing gate file, `readJson` will throw an unhandled `ENOENT` exception and crash the script. Since bulk gate files are critical validation files, ensure that a missing or malformed gate file returns a fail-closed receipt with `validation_status` set to `fail`, `failure_count` set to `1`, and passes appropriate diagnostics into the validation process, rather than crashing with an unhandled exception.

```javascript
  if (options.check && !generatedAtProvided) {
    const gatePath = path.join(options.root, options.paths.gateOut);
    if (!fs.existsSync(gatePath)) {
      return {
        validation_status: 'fail',
        failure_count: 1,
        diagnostics: 'Gate file is missing in check mode'
      };
    }
    const existing = readJson(options.root, options.paths.gateOut);
    if (existing?.generated_at) options.generatedAt = existing.generated_at;
  }
```

